    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's weird because hearing you say that actually feels almost... peaceful? like you're the first person to acknowledge that it's okay to just stop. everyone else keeps telling me to \"try one more time\" or \"it'll get better,\" but they don't get the math of it. the cost of living just outweighs everything now. why does it feel like giving up is the only logical conclusion?",
